          <Comment>Gets the planned risk/reward ratio for the trade, calculated as PlannedProfit divided by PlannedRiskAmount. A ratio of 2.0 means the planned reward is twice the planned risk (2:1 R/R). Calculated but also persisted for using in SQL queries.</Comment>
